{"articleNo":"85492","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=85492&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"대학생 금연 서포터즈 7기 모집(보건복지부)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.06.20","hit":"4834","attachments":[{"name":"금연서포터즈.jpg","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=85492&attachNo=71593"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">보건복지부에서 담배 없는 건강한 캠퍼스 분위기 조성을 위해</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;\"대학생 금연 서포터즈 7기\" 모집을 실시하고 있으니&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">관심있는 학생들의</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;많은&nbsp; 참여바랍니다. </span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">1. 모집대상 : 해외영행에 결격사유가 없고 &nbsp;열정적인 대학생이면 누구나 참여가능</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2. 모집요건 : 4인이상 10인 이하의 팀 구성</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">3. 모집기간 :&nbsp; 2013. 6. 30(일)까지</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">4. 지원방법 : 금연길라잡이 홈페이지(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a href=\"http://www.nosmokeguide.or.kr/\">www.nosmokeguide.or.kr</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)에서 신청서를 </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다운로드 받은후,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">E-mail 접수(</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><a href=\"mailto:nosmoking@hwan21.com\">nosmoking@hwan21.com</a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">)</span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; * 접수 시 파일명은 '팀명-학교-팀장이름'으로 할것</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (예:금연행복-금오공대-홍길동)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">5. 합격팀 발표 : 2013. 7. 3(수) 금연길라잡이 홈페이지 공지</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">6. 워크숍 일정 : 2013. 7. 15(월) ~ 16(화)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">7. 활동내용 : 보건복지부 지정 미션 수행+팀별 독창적인 금연캠페인</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">8. 시상내역 : 기본활동을 수행항 서포터즈 전원 보건복지부 장관 명의 '수료증' </span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 수여</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;최우수 활동상 1팀 : 금연선진국 탐방+보건복지부 장관상</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 우&nbsp; &nbsp;수 활동상 3팀 : 장학금 200만원+보건복지부 장관상</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;장&nbsp;&nbsp; 려 활동상 5팀 : 장학금 100만원+보건복지부 장관상</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">9. 문의사항 : 금연서포터즈 운영사무국 (Tel: 02)741-7402)</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">10. 주&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 관 : 보건복지부</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2013. 6. 20</span></p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학 생 처 장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
